<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish May non-EU exports 709.9 mln punts - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish May non-EU exports 709.9 mln punts - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's exports to countries outside the European Union rose to a seasonally adjusted 709.9 million Irish pounds in May from 565.8 million in April, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Imports from non-EU countries fell to a seasonally-adjusted 601.0 million punts from 668.4 million in April, the CSO said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 660 3377</p>
